<title>USA: IPO FILING - SpectRx Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - SpectRx Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			SpectRx Inc</p>
<p> Stock symbol			 SPRX.O</p>
<p> Estimated price range	   $10-12/shr</p>
<p> Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p> Shrs outstanding after IPO    7,567,590</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter	  Hambrecht &amp; Quist</p>
<p> Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: SpectRx is engaged in the research and development of products that offer painless and bloodless alternatives for glucose monitoring, diabetes screening and infant jaundice. Use of Proceeds: Continued development, testing and clinical trials for the company's products; continued research and development; sales, marketing and manufacturing activities; capital expenditures, working capital and other general corporate purposes</p>
<p> Financial Data in 000s:     1995		1996</p>
<p>   - Revenue		  $ 1,179	    $  452</p>
<p>   - Net Income(Loss)	  (680)	   (3,178)</p>
